        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion TB-E4, Sonoma Trim Towel Bar</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by Fusion, the Sonoma Towel Bar features the rustic appearance that has become the trademark style of the Sonoma wine country. This towel bar is available in 3 sizes: 18 inch, 24 inch, and 30 inch. Choose from either medium bronze or an oil rubbed bronze finish. Fusion hardware is some of the highest quality around and all of it is easy to install since it is packaged with the necessary mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/sonoma-towel-ring-fusion-tr-e4\"><b>Fusion TR-E4 Sonoma Towel Ring</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/sonoma-robe-hook-fusion-rh-e4\"><b>Fusion RH-E4 Sonoma Robe Hook</b></a>, and\r\n<a href=\"/products/sonoma-wall-mounted-toilet-paper-holder-fusion-ph-e4\"><b>Fusion PH-E4 Sonoma Toilet Paper Holder</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>TB-1-E4</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 2-5/8\" square</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-2-E4</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 2-5/8\" square</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n<b>TB-3-E4</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length: 30\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 2-5/8\" square</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
